### refuse-release-download rc=56
$ curl -sS -m 8 -o /tmp/b -w http=%{http_code} --cacert /s/bundle.pem -x 127.0.0.1:3128 https://github.com/acme/widgets/releases/download/v1/x 2>&1
curl: (56) CONNECT tunnel failed, response 403
http=000
